rm isn't for emergencies. If you're in crisis, call or text 988.","buttonLabel":"Send message","successMessage":"Thank you. Your message is with me, and I'll reply within two business days. If you'd rather not wait, you can book a call now.","register":"auto","frame":"default","layout":{"spaceTop":"default","spaceBottom":"default","visibility":"all"},"id":"kit-home-15","sample":false}},{"type":"NewWorldLetter","props":{"eyebrow":"Newsletter","title":"Stay in *the loop.*","lede":"A short note when something is coming up. Nothing else.","placeholder":"you@email.com","buttonLabel":"Join","successMessage":"Thanks. You are on the list.","register":"auto","frame":"default","layout":{"spaceTop":"default","spaceBottom":"default","visibility":"all"},"id":"kit-home-16","sample":true}},{"type":"NewWorldFaq","props":{"index":"15","eyebrow":"Questions","title":"Good to *know.*","lede":"Anything else, ask. A real person answers.","phone":"(760) 235-5031","email":"daniel@danieltyack.com","hours":"Mon to Fri, 9am to 6pm, by appointment","areasLabel":"Where we meet","areas":[],"rows":[],"register":"auto","frame":"default","layout":{"spaceTop":"default","spaceBottom":"default","visibility":"all"},"id":"kit-home-17","sample":false}},{"type":"NewWorldTools","props":{"index":"16","eyebrow":"Behind the door","title":"The tools that *run this place.*","lede":"A calendar, check-in at the door, memberships, your member list and a page you edit yourself. It all runs on Frequency, and your people stay yours.","buttonLabel":"","buttonHref":"","secondaryLabel":"","secondaryHref":"","note":"","rows":[{"icon":"users","title":"Groups","body":"Recurring gatherings with their own page and members"},{"icon":"calendar","title":"Calendar","body":"Every event on your site and in the app"},{"icon":"check","title":"The door","body":"A QR code that turns walk-ins into contacts"},{"icon":"award","title":"Memberships","body":"Sold from day one, with the member dropped into their group"},{"icon":"tag","title"